[00:00.000] 作词 : Thomas Bergersen/Felicia Farerre
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Thomas Bergersen
[00:29.900]Here we are
[00:29.900]我们在此地
[00:33.300]Riding the sky
[00:33.300]翱翔于天际
[00:37.000]Painting the night with the sun
[00:37.000]绘夜空以晨旭
[00:44.500]You and I, Mirrors of light
[00:44.500]你和我 交相辉映
[00:52.000]Twin flames of fire
[00:52.000]如两团火焰
[00:55.900]Lit in another time and place
[00:55.900]闪亮在彼时彼地
[01:01.900]I knew your name
[01:01.900]我曾知你生名
[01:05.000]I knew your face
[01:05.000]也曾忆你音容
[01:09.000]Your love and grace
[01:09.000]与你爱和魅力
[01:12.200]Past and present now embrace
[01:12.200]过往与现在汇聚
[01:16.700]Worlds collide in inner space
[01:16.700]世界激荡于内心
[01:20.850]Unstoppable, the song we play
[01:20.850]我们奏响的歌 永不停息
[01:27.800]（chorus）
[01:27.800]（合唱）
[01:28.000]Burn the page for me
[01:28.000]忘记我的过去
[01:31.300]I cannot erase the time of sleep
[01:31.300]沉睡时光我无法抹去
[01:35.300]I cannot be loved so set me free
[01:35.300]我不能被爱 所以放我自由
[01:39.000]I cannot deliver your love
[01:39.000]我不能传递你的爱
[01:42.000]Or caress your soul so
[01:42.000]也无法抚慰你的灵魂   那
[01:43.700]turn that page for me
[01:43.700]就让过往逝去
[01:46.850]I cannot embrace the touch that you give
[01:46.850]我不能接受你的拥抱
[01:49.850]I cannot find solace in your words
[01:49.850]也找不到安慰的话语
[01:53.000]I cannot deliver you your love
[01:53.000]我不能回应你的爱意
[01:57.000]or caress your soul
[01:57.000]也不能抚慰你的灵魂
[02:06.000]Age to age
[02:06.000]年复一年
[02:09.500]I feel the call
[02:09.500]我感到那呼唤
[02:13.000]Memory of future dreams
[02:13.000]未来梦想的记忆
[02:20.000]You and I, riding the sky
[02:20.000]你和我 相依比翼
[02:27.500]Keeping the fire bright
[02:27.500]让火焰永不熄
[02:33.000]From another time and place
[02:33.000]在彼时彼地
[02:38.000]I know your name
[02:38.000]我知你姓名
[02:41.800]I know your face
[02:41.800]将你容颜记住
[02:45.000]Your touch and grace
[02:45.000]和你的怀抱和魅力
[02:49.000]All of time can not erase
[02:49.000]时间也无法抹去
[02:52.800]What our hearts remember stays
[02:52.800]我们记得要留在哪里
[02:56.700]Forever on a song we play
[02:56.700]永远留在 我们的那首歌里
[03:04.800]（chorus）
